@HomelabAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5202

### List device groups / locations
GET {{HomelabAPI_HostAddress}}/api/devicegroup
Accept: application/json

### List all devices
GET {{HomelabAPI_HostAddress}}/api/device
Accept: application/json

### Register a device (AC1) - 201 Created
POST {{HomelabAPI_HostAddress}}/api/device
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kitchen Pi",
  "hostname": "pi-kitchen",
  "deviceType": "Computer",
  "ipAddress": "192.168.1.42",
  "deviceGroupId": "8f5d2a4e-3c1b-4e6a-9b7d-1a2b3c4d5e03"
}

### Invalid registration (AC2) - 400 with errors for Name, Hostname and IpAddress
POST {{HomelabAPI_HostAddress}}/api/device
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "hostname": "-not valid-",
  "deviceType": "Server",
  "ipAddress": "999.1.1.1"
}

### Duplicate hostname (AC4) - 409 Conflict (run after the first POST)
POST {{HomelabAPI_HostAddress}}/api/device
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Another Pi",
  "hostname": "PI-KITCHEN",
  "deviceType": "Computer"
}

### Device details (AC3) - replace the id with one returned by the POST
GET {{HomelabAPI_HostAddress}}/api/device/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###
